abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that ranks city areas for road maintenance from
  311 complaint records, and an out-of-time protocol that grades those
  rankings only on later outcomes the labelling rules never see: future
  complaint volume, resolution time, agency-confirmed defects and street
  pavement ratings. Applied to NYC and San Francisco data.
